headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

script:post-response {
  console.log(`[${req.getMethod()}] ${req.getUrl()} -> ${res.getStatus()} (${res.getResponseTime()}ms)`);
}

docs {
  Reason Hwang BFF SEC API collection.

  Recommended workflow:
  1. Synchronize the SEC company master.
  2. List companies to confirm the imported company.
  3. Synchronize filing metadata for the sample company.
  4. Download pending filings.
  5. Inspect filing status, rows, and downloaded report content.
  6. Retry failed downloads or update parser status when required.

  Warning:
  - Job requests call SEC endpoints and mutate the configured PostgreSQL database.
  - Review the selected environment before running an entire folder or collection.
  - Parser status update requires sampleAccessionNo to identify an existing filing.
}
